require(script.Parent.BookModule).loadBook({
	title = "STATEMENTS FROM SEPTEMBER 15";
	author = "scarletsigil";
	date = "04/29/25";
	publisher = "VISUAL PIANO STUDIOS";
	chapters = {{
		name = "CAUTIONARY NOTE";
		text = "The contents of this book was adapted from various announcements adapted from our communication server in English. Automated language translations may not accurately reflect the original messaging of this book. \n \nYou may turn to the next page by clicking on the > button.";
	}, {
		name = "FOREWORD";
		text = "FOREWORD \n \nThe contents of this book contain various statements published by Visual Piano Studios on September 15 2024. To say that it's taught us a thing or two about the importance of two-factor authentication would be an understatement; so much was at stake, and there was realistically we could do beyond engaging Roblox Support. I remain deeply grateful and indebted to the folks at Roblox for responding and assisting us so promptly in the restoration of our content. Above all though, the breakneck speed at which we were able to get everything back up and running as per normal wouldn't have been possible with the help of the entire Visual Piano Studios development team, who stayed up overnight to hold down the fort, while our owner, Hirumiro, continued to engage with Roblox. It is my hope that the writings here will provide you, the reader, with a more vibrant understanding of the events that unfolded that day, through the eyes of the community members who were present that very day. \n \nscarletsigil \nDeveloper, Visual Piano Studios";
	}, {
		name = "SEP 15 AT 0718H CST";
		text = "ANNOUNCEMENT \n \nsorry for the inconvenience!, we just regained permissions for the server, please do NOT click on ANY links at the moment as we clean up the server \n \nDisformed_Potato \nDeveloper, Visual Piano Studios \n \nwe'll put out a statement regarding this incident shortly -- thank you everyone for bearing with us through these difficult times \n \nscarletsigil \nDeveloper, Visual Piano Studios";
	}, {
		name = "SEP 15 AT 0739H CST";
		text = "STATEMENT \n \nHey everyone, the Visual Piano Studios group and all its games have been compromised. We currently have no access to the group or its games. This case has already been reported to Roblox Support, and we hope to recover both the group and the game soon. \nThe users behind today's attack have been removed from the server and we have temporarily paused all invites into the server. We will also temporarily restrict all public channels to view-only. \n \nBased on what we understand, this pre-planned attack was made possible by compromising the owner's account. Thereafter, ownership of the Visual Piano Studios group was transferred to a holder account used by the attackers. \n \nAfter gaining control of the Roblox group, the attackers removed all VP staff and developers from their roles, and promoted their users to those roles. This enabled the attackers to exploit a vulnerability in Bloxlink which automatically promoted users based on their group roles on Roblox. This gave the attackers control over the VP communications server. \n \nHaving ownership of the Roblox group also meant that they now had access to the Visual Pianos game, which allowed them to disseminate malicious information about their own server. Thereafter they migrated all servers to latest update, which forced all users to see the message, some of which have been sent on ⁠vp-screenshots. \n \n Our priority right now is to protect the community from further harm done by the attackers. \n \nRefrain from joining the Visual Pianos game. We no longer have access to the game and have no control over what is being published to the Visual Pianos game. Refrain from clicking any links that may seem suspicious. You should avoid clicking links sent by users you don't know. Refrain from contacting or interacting with any of the attackers directly. \n \nEnsure that your server account and Roblox account both have 2FA enabled. Avoid joining any suspicious servers or conducting investigations of your own. The team is working hard to recover what we can and restore the game as soon as possible. \n \nWe will send further updates here about the incident as soon as we can. In the meantime, please bear with us as we begin recovery efforts to the Roblox group and game. We'd like to thank everyone for supporting us through these difficult times. We'd also like to extend our gratitude to other developers in the community for assisting us with disseminating cautionary warnings to their players against clicking malicious links. Thank you everyone for your continued support. Please stay tuned for further updates in the coming days. \n \nVisual Piano Studios";
	}, {
		name = "SEP 15 AT 0804H CST";
		text = "ANNOUNCEMENT \n \nIf you are an owner of a community server we encourage you to forward the statement above to your own servers and encourage your members to follow the cautionary instructions above. Together, we can keep this community safe. \n \nscarletsigil \nDeveloper, Visual Piano Studios";
	}, {
		name = "SEP 15 AT 0916H CST";
		text = "ANNOUNCEMENT \n \nPLEASE we ask that you do not join the game. They are trying to access your account and this is dangerous. DO.NOT.JOIN.THE.GAME. (TO some extent, they're more or less trying to USE your account)\n \nnKristinn \nDirector, Visual Piano Studios";
	}, {
		name = "SEP 15 AT 1017H CST";
		text = "UPDATE \n \nWe have recovered ownership of the Roblox group and are now in the process of assessing the damage created. We'll restore the game as soon as we're able to do so. Thank you for your patience.\n \nscarletsigil \nDeveloper, Visual Piano Studios";
	}, {
		name = "SEP 15 AT 1239H CST";
		text = "STATEMENT \n \nHey everyone! Thank you for waiting. We've managed to restore full ownership of the Visual Piano Studios group and all its games. We'd like to express our deepest gratitude to all our players for supporting us through these difficult few hours. It is now safe to play Visual Pianos. \n \nThanks to the efforts from our community members, we managed to quickly investigate and identify the motive of the attackers. We've also managed to get a small snippet of what happened behind the scenes. I'll let the video do the talking, please enjoy. (Video is on community server) \n \nThe server will gradually reopen its doors in the coming days. We'd like to thank everyone, genuinely, for your continued patience and support for our game. Visual Pianos would not be possible without you all. \n \nIn addition, I'll drop the userIDs of the key users involved in this attack, so you can block/ban them in your own servers as well: \n \n751099771309260860 \n714177115662057552 \n745242014504845352 \n1284656349137080392 \n745278742783328377 \n601171978086514700 \n \nVisual Piano Studios";
	}, {
		name = "SEP 15 AT 1443H CST";
		text = "ANNOUNCEMENT \n \nEveryone who was falsely banned in the past 12 hours by the attackers, you have been unbanned\n \ngxvbby \nDeveloper, Visual Piano Studios";
	}, {
		name = "SEP 15 AT 1802H CST";
		text = "ANNOUNCEMENT \n \nThe server permissions (such as joining voice channels, talking in chats, and viewing message history) should all be back to normal. If you see any problems please ping or DM me.\n \ngxvbby \nDeveloper, Visual Piano Studios";
	}};
})]]></ProtectedString><BinaryString name="AttributesSerialize"></BinaryString><bool name="DefinesCapabilities">false</bool><string name="Name"><![CDATA[BookHandler]]></string><BinaryString name="Tags"></BinaryString></Properties></Item><Item class="ModuleScript" referent="21947"><Properties><ProtectedString name="Source"><![CDATA[-- Saved by UniversalSynSaveInstance (Join to Copy Games) https://discord.gg/wx4ThpAsmw

